<section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Schools &amp; Colleges</h2>
        <div class="school-grid">
            <div class="school-card"><h4>College of Arts & Sciences</h4><p>Largest academic unit. Humanities, sciences, social sciences, fine arts.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>Kenan-Flagler Business School</h4><p>MBA, undergraduate business, executive education. Ranked top 20 nationally.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Medicine</h4><p>Medical education, research, patient care. UNC Health system.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Law</h4><p>JD program, clinics, public interest law.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>Gillings School of Global Public Health</h4><p>#1 public school of public health. Epidemiology, biostatistics, health policy.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Education</h4><p>Teacher preparation, educational leadership, school counseling.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Information & Library Science</h4><p>Information science, digital curation, library studies.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Nursing</h4><p>BSN, MSN, DNP, PhD programs. Clinical training.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Pharmacy</h4><p>PharmD program, pharmaceutical research.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Dentistry</h4><p>DDS program, dental clinics, oral health research.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Social Work</h4><p>MSW program, clinical and community practice.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Government</h4><p>Public administration, local government training.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>School of Media & Journalism</h4><p>Journalism, advertising, public relations, digital media.</p></div>
            <div class="school-card"><h4>Hussman School of Journalism</h4><p>Media ethics, investigative reporting, visual storytelling.</p></div>
        </div>
